CI-runnable test for S4 + M2 scenarios with time bounds. JUnit XML output. Performance metrics exported for trend analysis.

h3. Implementation Notes

Test infrastructure updates needed:

* Add @pytest.mark.performance marker to pytest.ini
* Create tests/suites/performance/ directory
* Add pytest_sessionfinish hook for JSON report generation

JSON report schema (versioned in Git):

{code:json}{
  "metadata": {"timestamp", "chart_version", "test_profile", "cluster": {...}, "git_commit"},
  "metrics": {"source_registration_time_ms", "processing_time_ms", "api_latency_p95_ms", ...},
  "resource_usage": {"koku_api_cpu_avg", "celery_queue_depth_max", ...}
}{code}

Output location: reports/performance/YYYY-MM-DD_vX.X.X_scenario.json
